const titles={dashboard:'Dashboard',users:'Users Management',deposits:'Deposit Verification',withdrawals:'Withdrawal Management',plans:'Investment Plans',payments:'Payment Settings',transactions:'Transaction History',referrals:'Referral Management',settings:'Settings & Security'};
function go(p){state.page=p;document.querySelectorAll('[data-page]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.page===p));$('#pageTitle').textContent=titles[p];render()}
function toast(m){let t=$('#toast');t.textContent=m;t.classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove('show'),2500)}
function card(title,value,icon,sub='') {return `<div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-icon">${icon}</div><small>${title}</small><strong>${value}</strong><span>${sub}</span></div>`}
async function render(){const c=$('#content');c.innerHTML='<div class="loading">Loading...</div>';try{if(state.page==='dashboard'){const d=await api('/admin/dashboard');c.innerHTML=`<section class="stats">${card('Total Registered Users',d.totalUsers,'♙','+8.4% this month')}${card('Total Deposits',money(d.totalDeposits),'↓','Verified deposits')}${card('Pending Withdrawals',d.pendingWithdrawals,'↑','Needs review')}${card('Active Investments',d.activeInvestments,'◉','Currently running')}${card('Total Transactions',d.totalTransactions,'▤','Ledger records')}</section><div class="dashboard-grid"><section class="panel chart-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Overview</h2><small>Platform activity</small></div><select><option>This Month</option><option>Last Month</option></select></div><div class="chart"><div class="y-labels"><span>30K</span><span>20K</span><span>10K</span><span>0</span></div><div class="line-chart"><svg viewBox="0 0 700 230" preserveAspectRatio="none"><polyline points="0,190 60,160 120,175 180,120 240,145 300,90 360,125 420,65 480,110 540,50 600,95 700,35" fill="none" stroke="#13d7d0" stroke-width="4"/><polyline points="0,205 60,185 120,195 180,160 240,175 300,145 360,165 420,120 480,145 540,110 600,135 700,95" fill="none" stroke="#2a8cff" stroke-width="2" opacity=".55"/></svg></div></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Investments by Plan</h2><small>Distribution</small></div></div><div class="donut"><div><b>${d.investmentShare}%</b><small>Active</small></div></div><div class="legend"><span><i class="c1"></i>Plan 1 <b>${d.planBreakdown[0]||0}%</b></span><span><i class="c2"></i>Plan 2 <b>${d.planBreakdown[1]||0}%</b></span><span><i class="c3"></i>Standard <b>${d.planBreakdown[2]||0}%</b></span></div></section></div><div class="dashboard-grid bottom"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Recent Deposits</h2><button class="link" onclick="window.__go('deposits')">View All</button></div>${d.recentDeposits.map(x=>`<div class="table-row"><span class="avatar sm">${esc(x.username[0].toUpperCase())}</span><span><b>${esc(x.username)}</b><small>${esc(x.method||'Payment')}</small></span><strong>${money(x.amount)}</strong><small>${new Date(x.created_at).toLocaleDateString()}</small><span class="status ${x.status}">${x.status}</span></div>`).join('')||'<div class="empty">No deposits.</div>'}</section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Quick Summary</h2></div><div class="quick"><div><span class="qicon orange">↓</span><span>Pending Deposits</span><b>${d.pendingDeposits}</b></div><div><span class="qicon red">↑</span><span>Pending Withdrawals</span><b>${d.pendingWithdrawals}</b></div><div><span class="qicon blue">♙</span><span>Registered Users</span><b>${d.totalUsers}</b></div><div><span class="qicon green">▤</span><span>Total Transactions</span><b>${d.totalTransactions}</b></div></div></section></div>`}
else if(state.page==='users'){const users=await api('/admin/users');c.innerHTML=`<div class="toolbar"><div><h1>Users Management</h1><small>Registered customer accounts</small></div><input id="filter" placeholder="Search name or email..."></div><section class="panel table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>User</th><th>Email</th><th>Phone</th><th>Balance</th><th>Registered</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>${users.map(u=>`<tr><td><b>${esc(u.username)}</b></td><td>${esc(u.email)}</td><td>${esc(u.phone||'—')}</td><td>${money(u.balance)}</td><td>${new Date(u.created_at).toLocaleDateString()}</td><td><span class="status ${u.status}">${u.status}</span></td><td><button class="mini" onclick="window.__toggleUser(${u.id},'${u.status==='active'?'suspended':'active'}')">${u.status==='active'?'Suspend':'Activate'}</button></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></section>`;$('#filter').oninput=e=>document.querySelectorAll('tbody tr').forEach(r=>r.style.display=r.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(e.target.value.toLowerCase())?'':'none')}
else if(state.page==='deposits'){const rows=await api('/admin/deposits');c.innerHTML=`<div class="toolbar"><div><h1>Deposit Verification</h1><small>Review customer payment submissions</small></div></div><section class="panel table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>User</th><th>Amount</th><th>Method</th><th>Reference</th><th>Screenshot</th><th>Date</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.username)}</td><td>${money(x.amount)}</td><td>${esc(x.method||'—')}</td><td>${esc(x.reference||'—')}</td><td>${x.screenshot?`<a class="link" href="${API.replace('/api','')}${x.screenshot}" target="_blank">View</a>`:'—'}</td><td>${new Date(x.created_at).toLocaleString()}</td><td><span class="status ${x.status}">${x.status}</span></td><td>${x.status==='pending'?`<button class="mini success" onclick="window.__reviewDeposit(${x.id},'approve')">Approve</button><button class="mini danger" onclick="window.__reviewDeposit(${x.id},'reject')">Reject</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></section>`}
else if(state.page==='withdrawals'){const rows=await api('/admin/withdrawals');c.innerHTML=`<div class="toolbar"><div><h1>Withdrawal Management</h1><small>Review and complete withdrawal requests</small></div></div><section class="panel table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>User</th><th>Amount</th><th>Account</th><th>Available</th><th>Date</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.username)}</td><td>${money(x.amount)}</td><td>${esc(x.account_details)}</td><td>${money(x.available_balance)}</td><td>${new Date(x.created_at).toLocaleString()}</td><td><span class="status ${x.status}">${x.status}</span></td><td>${x.status==='pending'?`<button class="mini" onclick="window.__reviewWithdrawal(${x.id},'processing')">Processing</button><button class="mini success" onclick="window.__reviewWithdrawal(${x.id},'approve')">Complete</button><button class="mini danger" onclick="window.__reviewWithdrawal(${x.id},'reject')">Reject</button>`:x.status==='processing'?`<button class="mini success" onclick="window.__reviewWithdrawal(${x.id},'approve')">Complete</button><button class="mini danger" onclick="window.__reviewWithdrawal(${x.id},'reject')">Reject</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></section>`}
else if(state.page==='plans'){const rows=await api('/admin/plans');c.innerHTML=`<div class="toolbar"><div><h1>Investment Plans</h1><small>Manage the 10 published plans</small></div></div><section class="plan-admin-grid">${rows.map(x=>`<article class="plan-admin"><div class="plan-head"><span class="status ${x.active?'active':'inactive'}">${x.active?'ACTIVE':'DISABLED'}</span><button class="mini" onclick="window.__editPlan(${x.id})">Edit</button></div><h3>${esc(x.name)}</h3><b class="big-number">${money(x.amount)}</b><div class="muted-row"><span>Daily rate</span><b>${x.daily_rate}%</b></div><div class="muted-row"><span>Validity</span><b>${x.duration_days} days</b></div><button class="outline wide" onclick="window.__togglePlan(${x.id},${x.active?0:1})">${x.active?'Disable':'Enable'}</button></article>`).join('')}</section>`}
else if(state.page==='payments'){const s=await api('/admin/payment-settings');c.innerHTML=`<div class="toolbar"><div><h1>Payment Settings</h1><small>Changes appear on the client deposit page immediately.</small></div></div><section class="panel form-grid"><form id="paymentForm"><div class="method-box"><b>EasyPaisa</b><label><input type="checkbox" name="e_enabled" ${s.easypaisa.enabled?'checked':''}> Enabled</label><input name="e_name" value="${esc(s.easypaisa.account_name)}" placeholder="Account holder"><input name="e_number" value="${esc(s.easypaisa.account_number)}" placeholder="Account number"><textarea name="e_instructions" placeholder="Instructions">${esc(s.easypaisa.instructions)}</textarea></div><div class="method-box"><b>JazzCash</b><label><input type="checkbox" name="j_enabled" ${s.jazzcash.enabled?'checked':''}> Enabled</label><input name="j_name" value="${esc(s.jazzcash.account_name)}" placeholder="Account holder"><input name="j_number" value="${esc(s.jazzcash.account_number)}" placeholder="Account number"><textarea name="j_instructions">${esc(s.jazzcash.instructions)}</textarea></div><div class="method-box"><b>Bank Transfer</b><label><input type="checkbox" name="b_enabled" ${s.bank.enabled?'checked':''}> Enabled</label><input name="b_name" value="${esc(s.bank.account_name)}" placeholder="Account holder"><input name="b_number" value="${esc(s.bank.account_number)}" placeholder="Account number"><textarea name="b_instructions">${esc(s.bank.instructions)}</textarea></div><button class="primary">Save Payment Settings</button></form></section>`;$('#paymentForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.target);try{await api('/admin/payment-settings',{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({easypaisa:{enabled:f.has('e_enabled'),account_name:f.get('e_name'),account_number:f.get('e_number'),instructions:f.get('e_instructions')},jazzcash:{enabled:f.has('j_enabled'),account_name:f.get('j_name'),account_number:f.get('j_number'),instructions:f.get('j_instructions')},bank:{enabled:f.has('b_enabled'),account_name:f.get('b_name'),account_number:f.get('b_number'),instructions:f.get('b_instructions')}})});toast('Payment settings saved')}catch(err){toast(err.message)}}}
else if(state.page==='transactions'){const rows=await api('/admin/transactions');c.innerHTML=`<div class="toolbar"><div><h1>Transaction History</h1><small>Complete platform ledger</small></div><input id="filter" placeholder="Search transaction..."></div><section class="panel table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>User</th><th>Type</th><th>Amount</th><th>Reference</th><th>Date</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.username)}</td><td>${esc(x.type)}</td><td>${money(x.amount)}</td><td>${esc(x.reference||'—')}</td><td>${new Date(x.created_at).toLocaleString()}</td><td><span class="status ${x.status}">${x.status}</span></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></section>`;$('#filter').oninput=e=>document.querySelectorAll('tbody tr').forEach(r=>r.style.display=r.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(e.target.value.toLowerCase())?'':'none')}
else if(state.page==='referrals'){const r=await api('/admin/referrals');c.innerHTML=`<div class="toolbar"><div><h1>Referral Management</h1><small>Referral activity and rewards</small></div></div><section class="stats">${card('Total Referrals',r.total,'♧')}${card('Reward Paid',money(r.rewardPaid),'$')}${card('Pending Rewards',money(r.pendingRewards),'◈')}${card('Invalid Records',r.invalid,'!')}</section><section class="panel table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Referrer</th><th>Referred User</th><th>Code</th><th>Reward</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>${r.rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.referrer)}</td><td>${esc(x.referred)}</td><td>${esc(x.code)}</td><td>${money(x.reward)}</td><td><span class="status ${x.status}">${x.status}</span></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></section>`}
else if(state.page==='settings'){const s=await api('/admin/settings');c.innerHTML=`<div class="toolbar"><div><h1>Settings & Security</h1><small>Platform controls and audit history</small></div></div><div class="dashboard-grid"><section class="panel"><h2>Platform Information</h2><form id="settingsForm"><label>Platform name</label><input name="platform_name" value="${esc(s.platform_name)}"><label>Support email</label><input name="support_email" value="${esc(s.support_email)}"><label>Referral reward rate (%)</label><input name="referral_rate" type="number" step="0.01" value="${s.referral_rate}"><button class="primary">Save settings</button></form></section><section class="panel"><h2>Recent Audit Logs</h2>${s.logs.map(x=>`<div class="audit"><b>${esc(x.action)}</b><span>${esc(x.admin)}</span><small>${new Date(x.created_at).toLocaleString()}</small></div>`).join('')||'<div class="empty">No audit logs.</div>'}</section></div>`;$('#settingsForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();try{await api('/admin/settings',{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.target)))});toast('Settings saved')}catch(err){toast(err.message)}}}}
catch(e){c.innerHTML=`<section class="panel error">${esc(e.message)}</section>`}}
window.__go=go;window.__reviewDeposit=async(id,a)=>{try{await api(`/admin/deposits/${id}/${a}`,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({reason:a==='reject'?prompt('Rejection reason')||'Rejected by admin':undefined})});toast('Deposit updated');render()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};window.__reviewWithdrawal=async(id,a)=>{try{await api(`/admin/withdrawals/${id}/${a}`,{method:'POST'});toast('Withdrawal updated');render()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};window.__toggleUser=async(id,status)=>{try{await api(`/admin/users/${id}/status`,{method:'PATCH',body:JSON.stringify({status})});toast('User status updated');render()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};window.__togglePlan=async(id,active)=>{try{await api(`/admin/plans/${id}`,{method:'PATCH',body:JSON.stringify({active:!!active})});toast('Plan status updated');render()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};window.__editPlan=async id=>{const rows=await api('/admin/plans');const x=rows.find(r=>r.id===id);const name=prompt('Plan name',x.name);if(name===null)return;const amount=prompt('Investment amount',x.amount);if(amount===null)return;const rate=prompt('Daily rate %',x.daily_rate);if(rate===null)return;const days=prompt('Validity days',x.duration_days);if(days===null)return;try{await api(`/admin/plans/${id}`,{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify({name,amount:Number(amount),daily_rate:Number(rate),duration_days:Number(days)})});toast('Plan saved');render()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};
